WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.589 --> 00:00:10.120
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and this week
on arrow it’s christmas and everyone deserves

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.120
a present.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.740
We find out who the real big bad is this season
and barry allen became the flash.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.529
So because this was the mid season finale
arrow won’t be back for 5 weeks, but I’ll

00:00:16.529 --> 00:00:19.570
be doing bonus videos between now and then,
so subscribe to get everything.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:21.590
I’ll also be doing flash videos too.

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:24.630
Since there were so many big payoffs let’s
do our top 10 moments and then I’ll do my

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:25.630
review.

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:26.650
Number 10 - Star Labs.

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:30.570
the particle accelerator malfunctions, and
given the riots going on when it was working

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:33.559
it’s unlikely that they continue with that
line of technology.

00:00:33.559 --> 00:00:36.301
Leaving them free to experiment more with
other things like cyborgs.

00:00:36.301 --> 00:00:37.660
Star Labs is in central city, so any future
superheroes to come from it will most likely

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:38.660
be featured on the flash show first, not on
arrow.

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:39.660
9 Solomon Grundy poem.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:42.829
A lot of you caught the cyrus gold solomon
grundy nod last week.

00:00:42.829 --> 00:00:45.820
This week they even read the poem out loud.

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:46.820
Twice.

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:50.710
Solomon Grundy, Born on a Monday, Christened
on a Tuesday, Married on a wednesday, took

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:56.160
ill on Thursday, grew worse on Friday, died
on saturday, buried on sunday, that was the

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.160
end.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:58.160
of solomon grundy.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:01.350
By the way, he is definitely not dead, despite
what oliver thinks.

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:04.909
8 ballicity - Barry let’s felicity know
that if she’s ever wants to go on a date,

00:01:04.909 --> 00:01:06.060
he’ll never be late.

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:09.869
A nice nod to the flash and it teases that
they’ll be dating in the future.

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:14.040
Since grant gustin isn’t going to guest
star on arrow every week as the flash, oliver

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:18.270
and diggle will probably just tease felicity
about her and barry every once in a while.

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:22.880
The other funny thing about barry is that
he’s not just jealous of oliver for getting

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:26.609
to be with felicity all the time, he’s jealous
of felicity for getting to be around the arrow

00:01:26.609 --> 00:01:27.609
all the time.

00:01:27.609 --> 00:01:28.609
Man crush red alert.

00:01:28.609 --> 00:01:30.630
7 Slade’s New Powers - Slade wakes up on
the sub and he’s pissed.

00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:34.999
He doesn’t even realize he has super powers
until he starts snapping guns in half like

00:01:34.999 --> 00:01:37.439
they’re pencils and punching holes in guys
chests.

00:01:37.439 --> 00:01:41.499
Easily one of the best revenge moments of
the season so far.

00:01:41.499 --> 00:01:44.219
6 You should look into compressible micro
fabric.

00:01:44.219 --> 00:01:48.290
Barry totally teases not only oliver’s green
arrow mask, but his flash suit.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:53.119
If anyone is wondering, the creators have
said that his flash outfit won’t be exactly

00:01:53.119 --> 00:01:54.349
like the comics.

00:01:54.349 --> 00:01:58.329
But it will probably be something plain looking
made out of compressible micro fabric.

00:01:58.329 --> 00:02:00.869
Barry also has a keen eye for use of color.

00:02:00.869 --> 00:02:03.749
He grills oliver on his choice of green.

00:02:03.749 --> 00:02:07.270
This attention to color detail is important
later.

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:10.099
5 Good thing you have a rat problem.

00:02:10.099 --> 00:02:11.650
Barry wakes oliver up with poison.

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:12.650
Amazing.

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:14.440
It was funny and a little terrifying in the
same moment.

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:17.430
Good to know that rat poison works as a blood
thinner.

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:20.510
But i’d check with your doctor before trying
it at home.

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:22.170
4 barry left a present for you.

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:26.459
Barry leaves oliver his green arrow mask and
wraps it in newspaper with a red flash on

00:02:26.459 --> 00:02:27.459
the corner.

00:02:27.459 --> 00:02:30.069
Just more teasing, but oliver is now one step
closer to taking the green arrow name.

00:02:30.069 --> 00:02:33.209
It will happen this season, but first he has
to battle slade and brother blood to prove

00:02:33.209 --> 00:02:34.500
he’s a true hero.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:35.500
3 Roy has powers.

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:38.940
If it wasn’t clear from this episode, then
the teaser for the next episode made it plain

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:39.940
as day.

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:43.120
Roy has all the same powers solomon grundy
and slade have.

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.290
Super strength, super speed, super durability.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:48.170
A lot of you have been wondering if he’s
going to become speedy.

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:51.659
Here’s how it happened in the comic books,
first he was green arrow’s sidekick and

00:02:51.659 --> 00:02:56.609
was called speedy, then he joined teen titans
and became arsenal, then he joined the justice

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:58.349
league and became red arrow.

00:02:58.349 --> 00:03:01.750
Because they used the red arrows in previous
episodes, I’m thinking that they’ll just

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:05.140
skip to roy calling himself an version of
the red arrow.

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:06.140
Like Red.

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:09.420
Oliver, felicity and diggle will probably
tease him by calling him speedy though.

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:12.810
He’ll spend the rest of this season learning
to control his powers.

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:14.510
As seen in the new teaser.

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:16.120
2 Slade is the new big bad.

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:17.120
So not only is slade still alive, he’s also
the one behind brother blood.

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:22.090
The creators said in a recent interview that
after slade found shado dead and vowed revenge,

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:25.170
things did not get better between him and
oliver.

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:29.230
Oliver said that he killed everyone that took
the serum on the island.

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:32.150
so at some point he probably tried to kill
slade and believed him dead.

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.150
But because he’s super now, he has super
healing powers.

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:34.150
And a rad silver highlight with an eyepatch.

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.150
So close to classic deathstroke, so awesome.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:36.150
and my number 1 moment.

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:37.150
barry allen becomes the flash.

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.870
As predicted Barry was infused with the speedforce.

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:42.579
It was a nice nod to the classic barry allen
flash story happening in his lab.

00:03:42.579 --> 00:03:46.790
If you were confused, the particle accelerator
tore a hole in space time and the lightning

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:50.280
that struck him was the speed force, not just
regular lightning.

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:53.840
The yellow and red liquids rising up were
a nice visual reference to what’s coming.

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:56.940
The creators have said that he won’t be
wearing red spandex, but remember how barry

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:59.239
was talking to oliver about compression fabric.

00:03:59.239 --> 00:04:01.709
And remember what a big deal color is for
him.

00:04:01.709 --> 00:04:05.279
But let me know what your favorite moment
was, was it watching barry become the flash,

00:04:05.279 --> 00:04:18.269
was it seeing slade again?

00:04:18.269 --> 00:04:32.630
Like I said, i’ll be doing regular arrow
and flash bonus vids during the break.

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:51.630
be sure to subscribe to get them.

00:04:51.630 --> 00:05:01.639
be sure to let me know what you want me to
include in them.

