Right now click here to watch last week’s
arrow video and click here for my breakdown

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:07.580
of the doctor who christmas special.

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:09.240
Thanks for watching, high fives.

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:10.559
see you guys tomorrow!

